          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Which of the following relations are also functions?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p14-task-03-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "‘is larger than’",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Not a function.",
          "worked": "One input can have several outputs: $3>1$ and $3>2$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-task-03-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "‘plus one is’",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Function.",
          "worked": "Each real input $a$ gives exactly one output, $b=a+1$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-task-03-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "‘speaks the language’",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Not a function.",
          "worked": "A person may speak several languages, so one input can have several outputs.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-task-03-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "‘is equal to’",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Function.",
          "worked": "Each input $a$ has exactly one equal output, $b=a$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-task-03-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "‘is the brother of’",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Not a function.",
          "worked": "A person can be the brother of several people, or of none. Exactly one output per input is not guaranteed.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-task-03-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "‘is a similar triangle to’",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Not a function.",
          "worked": "A triangle can be similar to several triangles, so one input can have several outputs.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-task-03-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "‘has a positive square root of’",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Function on positive real inputs.",
          "worked": "On the intended domain $(0,\\infty)$, each input $a$ has exactly one positive output, $b=\\sqrt{a}$. Zero has no positive square root, and negative real numbers have no real square root.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-task-03-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "‘squared is equal to’",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Function.",
          "worked": "Each real input $a$ gives exactly one output, $b=a^2$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-task-03-i",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "i",
        "prompt": "‘is the square of’",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Not a function.",
          "worked": "Here $a=b^2$. The input $4$ has two outputs because $4=2^2$ and $4=(-2)^2$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-task-03-j",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "j",
        "prompt": "‘rounded to two decimal places is’",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Function.",
          "worked": "Using a fixed rounding convention, each real input has exactly one output rounded to two decimal places.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      }
    ]
  },
